    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42058" root="وطأ" body-key="w">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَطِىْءٌ</span></b>  <i>Plain, level, smooth, soft,</i> or <i>easy to be
travelled,</i> or <i>to walk</i> or <i>ride</i> or <i>lie upon.</i> (S, K,
TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَابَّةٌ وَطِىْءٌ</span> (IAar) <i>A beast easy to ride
upon.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَيْشٌ وَطِىْءٌ</span> [<i>An easy life</i>].
(TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَطِىْءُ الخُلُقِ</span> <i>Easy in nature,</i> or <i>dispositon.</i> (TA.)

